dict-jargon for Debian
----------------------

The *.orig.tar.gz file was created using 3 files from jargsrc.tar.gz as follows:

wget http://catb.org/~esr/jargon/jargsrc.tar.gz
tar zxvf jargsrc.tar.gz jargon.xml jargon.xsl jargon-text.xsl
chmod 644 jargon.xml jargon.xsl jargon-text.xsl

 -- Ruben Molina <ruben.molina@udea.edu.co>  Thu, 03 Sep 2015 22:11:26 -0400
